It is now March.
It is the afternoon.
It is very hot in Kochi right now.
There is strong sunlight.
I am walking down a busy road.
I am feeling extremely hot.
I am sweating a lot.
I am very tired.
I need some cold water.
I also need some rest.
I look around.
I see a small café on the side of the road.
I need a break from the heat outside.
I walk quickly to that café.
I open the door and step inside.
It is nicely cold inside the café.
I feel a great relief.
